CS 214 Project III: A Simple Shell

Partners
--------
Ali Ahsanuddin (aa3281)
Almer Capella (ac2945)

Build
-----
Run `make` to build `mysh`.

Test plan
---------
Run `make test` to execute tests/run_tests.sh. The test suite checks:

* external commands and the shell's always-successful exit status;
* the cd, pwd, which, and exit built-ins;
* input redirection, truncating output redirection, and append redirection;
* pipelines and the status of the final pipeline command;
* wildcard expansion, including the no-match case;
* comments, empty commands, syntax errors, missing commands, and command
  arguments containing spaces;
* batch-mode input from a file and the required /dev/null standard input for
  child processes.